# LLHB runner: per-run CLI sandbox HOME (never versioned)
benchmarks/llhb/results/runs/.sandbox/
# LLHB treatment runs retrieve statutory text, and legal text does not live in
# this repo (CLAUDE.md). Tool payloads and the transcripts that embed them stay
# local; records.jsonl keeps each payload's SHA-256, and the corpus is pinned,
# so (tool, arguments, pin) regenerates the bytes the hash was taken over.
# The Stage 5 control pilots predate this and stay tracked.
benchmarks/llhb/results/runs/*/tools/
benchmarks/llhb/results/runs/*/raw/
